  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESorry, your request to change your email address could not be confirmed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlease check that you used the exact link in the email we sent you, and that it is still valid. The link is valid for 24 hours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBack to \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:b0d6cf0f-ca87-4ecd-aed4-ef4c8cc6abde}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022My account\u0022\u003EMy account\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </confirmationFailed>
    <confirmationSuccessful>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThank you for confirming your email address \u003Cstrong\u003E{{EMAIL}}\u003C/strong\u003E. Your account has been updated.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen you next sign in to Stoolball England you\u0027ll need to use your new email address along with your password.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBack to \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:b0d6cf0f-ca87-4ecd-aed4-ef4c8cc6abde}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022My account\u0022\u003EMy account\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
